---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — December"
  description="Privacy Policy and Data Protection standards for December."
  canonicalUrl="https://trydecember.com/privacy"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm font-mono text-[#888888] mb-8">Last Updated: September 2026</p>

    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none text-[#cccccc] space-y-6 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        Phasehumans ("December", "we", "us", or "our") respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal and codebase data. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect information when you use the December CLI, December Cloud, and related services.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4 border-b border-[#222222] pb-2">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Account Information:</strong> When creating an account, we collect your email address and authentication identifiers provided by identity providers such as Google or GitHub.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Codebase & Session Data:</strong> When you invoke December Cloud or use the <code>/handoff</code> command, we process the codebase files and instruction history necessary to execute agent runs within isolated cloud sandboxes.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Bring Your Own Key (BYOK):</strong> If you provide your own API keys for OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, or OpenRouter, these keys are stored encrypted and used solely to route requests on your behalf.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4 border-b border-[#222222] pb-2">2. How We Use Information</h2>
      <p>We use your information strictly to provide, maintain, and secure the December software development platform. We do not sell your personal data or codebase contents to third parties.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4 border-b border-[#222222] pb-2">3. Data Retention & Deletion</h2>
      <p>You can delete your account, session histories, and uploaded artifacts at any time via the account settings panel or by contacting team@trydecember.com.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4 border-b border-[#222222] pb-2">4. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please email <a href="mailto:team@trydecember.com" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">team@trydecember.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
